ib.Path` per gestione percorsi","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"4. Moduli e Package","block_property":"heading_3"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Organizzazione progetto, `__init__.py`, `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"`pip` e requirements.txt","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"5. Librerie per Cloud/DevOps","block_property":"heading_3"}},{"content_block":{"content":"`boto3` (AWS SDK), `azure-*` (Azure SDK), `google-cloud-*` (GCP SDK)","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"`docker-py` per container","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"`kubernetes` client per K8s","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"`paramiko` per SSH automation","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"`requests` per API REST","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"⚡ Punti Chiave","block_property":"heading_2"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Python è usato **trasversalmente** — scripting, automazione cloud, data analysis","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**Type hints** migliorano manutenibilità e permettono type checking statico","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Preferire **pathlib.Path** a `os.path` per manipolazione path","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"Usare **context manager** (`with`) per file e connessioni","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"I file di esercizi e progetti sono in `02_Esercizi/` e `03_Progetti/`","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"📎 Risorse Collegate","block_property":"heading_2"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**02_Esercizi/**: Esercizi Python","block_property":"bulleted_list_item"}},{"content_block":{"content":"**03_Pr